sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent runtime
  participant E as Event gateway
  participant C as Chat service
  participant N as Notif service
  participant M as Email service
  actor U as User
  A->>E: hook TaskCompleted (http)
  E->>E: cek signature, session ke user
  E->>C: event ke thread
  E->>N: kirim notifikasi
  N->>U: push
  N->>M: ringkasan (opsional)
  M->>U: email
